DISPOSITION
================================================================================
A complete, HIG-native SwiftUI PresetGallery page shipped at parity with the web source: a pure
@Observable state holder (ADR-004 — no networking in the view) exposing loading/empty/error/success
over an injectable `PresetGalleryDataSource` seam (default = an API-shaped sample of eight Quick-Start
templates; the production host binds the shared KMP `useAutomationPresets` use-case). Both web GlassPanels
are reproduced — GlassPanel1 the preset card (TSIconBox glyph + name + first-trigger label / noTrigger +
count badge + 2-line description + full-width Install button) and GlassPanel2 the loading skeleton card —
on the P2 tokens + P3 shared components (TSGlassPanel/TSIconBox/TSButton/TSEmptyState/TSQueryError/
TSSkeleton/TSFadeIn/TSStaggerItem), no hand-rolled glass; the grid is adaptive (1-up compact iPhone →
multi-up iPad/macOS, ADR-002/006); every visible string resolves from Localizable.xcstrings with the web
key names (zero hardcoded text); VoiceOver labels/hints on cards + the install action; install navigation
